this on her Instagram story.

00:45:03.947 --> 00:45:04.933
Oh she did?

00:45:06.100 --> 00:45:08.010
I didn't realize it until the next day,

00:45:08.010 --> 00:45:09.650
that like my duck walk

00:45:09.650 --> 00:45:12.476
