ridicule you for them.

00:45:19.430 --> 00:45:21.650
I mean, that's what
America's all about, man.

00:45:21.650 --> 00:45:22.870
Desperate man.

00:45:22.870 --> 00:45:25.600
I would've stripped down naked

00:45:25.600 --> 00:45:29.847
